Wei Yang Palace

22
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:22,270
Orthodox Academy is here!

23
00:02:38,810 --> 00:02:40,020
Mister?

24
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:43,020
You go in first

25
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:46,220
Okay

26
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:53,100
General

27
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:04,310
I thought that you wouldn’t come for the third night of Qing Tong Yan. Why did you?

28
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:10,180
I am a student of Orthodox Academy. Therefore, I have the right to attend Qing Tong Yan

29
00:03:10,220 --> 00:03:14,430
That means you’re not planning on keeping the promise you’ve made

30
00:03:15,390 --> 00:03:20,390
I plan on keeping my promise, but I don’t know if everyone else will be able to

31
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,060
Hmph. How naive

32
00:05:15,170 --> 00:05:17,210
If you can keep your promise

33
00:05:17,210 --> 00:05:19,010
And not cause a big disturbance at the wedding,

34
00:05:19,010 --> 00:05:21,130
I am willing to spare your life

35
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:25,130
Wait a minute. The person who needs to keep his promise the most is you, General!

36
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:29,170
The marriage vow from before...

37
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:31,210
Is the true promise that you must keep

38
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:45,920
Mister, this thousand mile button will help you in your time of need

39
00:06:25,210 --> 00:06:27,550
Is that..??

40
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:36,920
Hmph. Let's just say you got lucky this time

41
00:06:40,670 --> 00:06:41,960
Thank you very much

42
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:18,510
You've awoken!

43
00:07:21,130 --> 00:07:22,590
We meet again, Miss Mo Yu

44
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:25,130
I always thought that you were an intelligent person

45
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:28,510
You didn't attend the second night of Qing Tong Yan

46
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:31,260
So I was under the impression that you've already made your decision regarding Qing Tong Yan

47
00:07:31,550 --> 00:07:34,340
That was probably the right choice

48
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:36,510
But, you showed up here again tonight

49
00:07:36,510 --> 00:07:38,090
I'm a bit disappointed

50
00:07:38,090 --> 00:07:40,590
I beg that you make the right decision which I know you're capable of

51
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:42,090
Forget about that marriage vow

52
00:07:42,090 --> 00:07:42,880
Why?

53
00:07:43,170 --> 00:07:44,880
In order to ensure stability

54
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:46,710
But this isn't fair!

55
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:48,590
Of course it isn't

56
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:51,380
There isn't a lot of fairness in this time and age, after all

57
00:07:51,590 --> 00:07:53,710
Let's take your abilities into account

58
00:07:53,710 --> 00:07:56,670
Comparing it to Xu You Rong or Qiu Shan Jun,

59
00:07:56,670 --> 00:07:59,050
Is already not fair

60
00:07:59,710 --> 00:08:02,710
In order to repel the demon clan, humanity needs to unite together

61
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:03,760
For this reason

62
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:10,460
No matter if the person is a court official, or representative from the south, they will all encourage the wedding between Qiu Shan Jun and Xu You Rong

63
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:14,010
For the benefit of society

64
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:15,840
You are too ignorant of that

65
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:18,010
If even you came

66
00:08:18,010 --> 00:08:20,760
Then I will have to continue attending Qing Tong Yan

67
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:22,460
Is that so?

68
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:49,800
Please don't try to mess with my calculations. Just give up

69
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:52,460
You know, at first, I didn't even care about this marriage stuff

70
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:54,260
But because of your actions,

71
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,840
It keeps on reminding me

72
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,460
That I need a wife in the future

73
00:08:58,010 --> 00:08:59,170
All of you are pressuring me

74
00:08:59,170 --> 00:09:01,510
To slowly start caring about this matter

75
00:09:01,710 --> 00:09:04,920
I don't like what all of you have tried doing to me before

76
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:07,130
If you want to use force,

77
00:09:07,130 --> 00:09:09,050
Then I need to make your life miserable as well

78
00:09:09,050 --> 00:09:10,880
Now that's fair!

79
00:09:11,210 --> 00:09:13,590
Okay. Let's assume that's fair then

80
00:09:13,590 --> 00:09:16,670
We'll see who will claim victory between the two of us

81
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:21,460
Tonight is your best opportunity to break up the marriage plans

82
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:25,710
Of course, you need to first be able to leave this place first

83
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:32,130
I suggest you think things over carefully

84
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:35,630
And wait for Qing Tong Yan to finish

85
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:48,010
Legends say that there was a dragon, buried deep underground. One day, it rose up into the sky, but no one knows where it went

86
00:10:21,710 --> 00:10:26,260
Could this be the spell used to imprison the king in <i>Nan Ke Ji</i> at Tong Palace?

87
00:10:21,710 --> 00:10:26,260
T/N: <> was a famous play written by Tang Xian Zu during the Ming Dynasty

88
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:37,010
No matter how strong the spell is, there is always a way out.

89
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:39,510
I just need to remember how each of these spells work

90
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,590
When they're changing, and when they're not

91
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:46,050
That will allow me the chance to escape

92
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:51,460
Here's the exit!

93
00:11:29,130 --> 00:11:30,090
A dragon?

94
00:11:30,090 --> 00:11:31,130
The imperial palace

95
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:32,380
Really does have a dragon!

96
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:41,460
What did you do to Chen Chang Sheng?

97
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:45,260
It looks like you already know the matters regarding Chen Chang Sheng

98
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,460
Please forgive me

99
00:11:52,210 --> 00:11:54,710
I know that you did this to benefit us as a whole

100
00:11:54,710 --> 00:11:56,460
