101
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:59,670
However, Xu You Rong is a child who has her own opinions

102
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:01,670
Did you ask for her thoughts?

103
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:06,210
To marry the Dragon and the Phoenix together to ensure smooth sailing, that's a bit too boring

104
00:12:06,210 --> 00:12:08,380
But that Chen Chang Sheng-

105
00:12:10,090 --> 00:12:12,710
We simply can't stand on the sidelines and look on

106
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:16,460
I'm sure the others will make a decision that we find to be satisfactory

107
00:12:16,590 --> 00:12:18,260
I understand, Empress

108
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,960
I will immediately go and help with the third night of Qing Tong Yan

109
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:51,210
Looks like Master was right

110
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:52,130
