114
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:04,340
I need to use xiu xing to change my fate before my twentieth birthday

115
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:10,300
That way, I will be able to have experiences past the age of twenty

116
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:13,840
That looks hard now. I will probably die right here

117
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:17,170
Thank you for not swallowing me in one bite

118
00:13:17,300 --> 00:13:18,960
But I really want to continue living!

119
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:21,170
That probably sounds like a joke

120
00:13:21,710 --> 00:13:24,630
Let me have one last battle with you!

121
00:14:07,590 --> 00:14:11,460
No one can tell if they truly understand their situation. I can't tell, either

122
00:14:11,710 --> 00:14:13,800
