131
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:59,670
A message from the Empress herself:

132
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:02,380
Everyone should welcome this marriage

133
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:08,460
She also hopes that with the north and south united, we will be able to repel the demon clan

134
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,920
